# Google OAuth (optional). Create a Web client in Google Cloud Console.
# Authorized JS origin: http://localhost:3000
# Authorized redirect URI: http://127.0.0.1:54321/auth/v1/callback
# Put these in the environment used by `supabase start` (often project root `.env`),
# then restart: pnpm supabase:stop && pnpm supabase:start
# SUPABASE_AUTH_EXTERNAL_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# SUPABASE_AUTH_EXTERNAL_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Optional: keep cloud credentials in .env.cloud.local and swap when needed.

# Optional (next dev only): allow HMR when opening the app via 127.0.0.1
# instead of localhost. Comma-separated hostnames, no scheme/port.
# ALLOWED_DEV_ORIGINS=127.0.0.1

